  "summary": "Solid implementation with good architecture, proper streaming uploads, lease-based concurrency, and correct Azure SDK patterns. Main weaknesses are: (1) no RestError-specific error handling — missing 409 lease conflict and 404 not-found handling, (2) listBlobs() accumulates all results into an array instead of yielding them for streaming consumption, and (3) @azure/logger is imported but not listed as a direct dependency in package.json.",
  "issues": [
